<div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mikerand</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1176380-looking-for-a-storyteller-for-promethean?p=1192760#post1192760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this still a thing? I own all the Promethean products (including 2nd). I am guessing for Online play? Like Skype / Google Hangouts / TeamSpeak / Whatever? I am in the USA CST and work a normal job - so I could start after 7pm CST during the week or anytime on Saturdays or Sundays. Even if you aren't looking for a ST, I would love to join such a game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hello. Yes this is still a thing. I'd love for you to storytelling me a game of Promethean. Discord would be ideal. I'm the only player so far","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T11:50:56-08:00","id":1193652,"title":"","content":"Okay I've ran three Promethean chronicles total and in only one of them did any of the characters achieve their New Dawn. Just a few things before I take on the HUGE responsibility of making a new Promethean chronicle:<ul><li>I'd prefer to have at least two players (but no more then three or four total) so let's try to find at least one more player and I would prefer ALL promethean characters (no crossover characters please).</li> <li>How often would you like to play?</li> <li>What length of chronicle are looking for (how long do you want to play)?</li> <li>Is there anything specific you are looking for in a Promethean chronicle? Like a theme, element, or anything else?</li> <li>Anything you don't want to see? I'll be honest, I almost never use Qashmallim for instance.</li> <li>Anything else I should know?</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2826-mikerand","name":"mikerand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2826_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T12:31:00-08:00","id":1193673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mikerand</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1176380-looking-for-a-storyteller-for-promethean?p=1193652#post1193652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay I've ran three Promethean chronicles total and in only one of them did any of the characters achieve their New Dawn. Just a few things before I take on the HUGE responsibility of making a new Promethean chronicle:<ul><li>I'd prefer to have at least two players (but no more then three or four total) so let's try to find at least one more player and I would prefer ALL promethean characters (no crossover characters please).</li> <li>How often would you like to play?</li> <li>What length of chronicle are looking for (how long do you want to play)?</li> <li>Is there anything specific you are looking for in a Promethean chronicle? Like a theme, element, or anything else?</li> <li>Anything you don't want to see? I'll be honest, I almost never use Qashmallim for instance.</li> <li>Anything else I should know?</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>You could make a post in this sub forum to look for one more player<br /> Thrice a week would be sufficient<br /> A really long chronicle would be nice<br /> The central theme should be mystery,i want to play a character travelling the country solving mysteries and unishing criminals<br /> I'd like to avoid rape and racism<br /> I'm a vry much new player,and i don't have the rules memorized yet,so you'd have to be very patient with me,is that okay?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T19:22:25-08:00","id":1193777,"title":"","content":"Three times a week? I am not sure I can commit to that - how about once a week? And we can do some play by post. I like the Tavern-Keeper website, it's nice.<br /> <br /> Everything else looks fine and I can do that - no worries about the rules - I am not all that familiar with 2nd edition anyways.<br /> <br /> Give me a few days to come up with a chronicle and I will post our desire for at least one more play.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2826-mikerand","name":"mikerand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2826_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T07:56:24-08:00","id":1193924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mikerand</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1176380-looking-for-a-storyteller-for-promethean?p=1193777#post1193777\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Three times a week? I am not sure I can commit to that - how about once a week? And we can do some play by post. I like the Tavern-Keeper website, it's nice.<br /> <br /> Everything else looks fine and I can do that - no worries about the rules - I am not all that familiar with 2nd edition anyways.<br /> <br /> Give me a few days to come up with a chronicle and I will post our desire for at least one more play.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Okay,play by post then. Just send me a link to the website when you're ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T08:38:46-08:00","id":1193931,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I meant we can Discord once a week - but PBP the rest of the time. It'll be a Tavern-Keeper website - just need some time to come up with a few things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2826-mikerand"